      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannon_Beach%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A whale sculpture in Cannon Beach commemorates a historic event where expedition members found beached whale blubber in 1805.",
